Package: plugin-db-dev
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: libssl-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: pin of a plugin: one header and its pkg-config file
 <plugin-db/pin.h>, header-only, on libc and libcrypto: the SHA-256 of a file,
 the omx-layout/1 fingerprint of a parameter layout, the words a pin is written
 with and the rules of what is a pin's, with the pkg-config file plugin-db.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: plugin-db-contract
Section: libs
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: omx-contract (>= 3.2.0~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: words of a plugin pin in omx-contract's contract directory
 data/pin.json of plugin-db, the verdicts, the pool words, the optional keys,
 what counts as changed and the layout formats, as the package plugin-db of
 omx-contract's contract directory, under
 /usr/share/omx-contract/contract.d/3/plugin-db.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.
